# --- Terraform ---
# infra/bootstrap/'s own local state is committed on purpose — it carries nothing
# sensitive and its reproducibility matters more than the noise (design.md,
# "Bootstrap osobnym katalogiem ze stanem lokalnym"). Everything else here uses a
# remote backend and never has a local state file to ignore in the first place.
infra/**/.terraform/
infra/**/*.tfplan
infra/**/tfplan
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
